description.narrative:
This project aims to influence public policies in order to have legislation that contributes to fair value distribution, Decent Work and sustainable Natural Resources Management. To influence these policies we work in coalition with other Civil Society Organizations. Policies we aim to influence are:
EU legislation on mandatory Human Right and Environmental Due Diligence; 
EU legislation on imported deforestation
NL legislation on mandatory Environmental and Human Right Due Diligence;

comment.narrative:
